# Galaxy Health needs no environment variables to run.
#
# Core features work offline against the on-device SQLite database
# (galaxyhealth.db). There is deliberately no EXPO_PUBLIC_* provider key here:
# anything prefixed EXPO_PUBLIC_ is inlined into the JS bundle and is therefore
# public.
#
# Optional AI (cross-planet Synthesis) is Bring Your Own Key:
# paste your Claude / OpenAI / Grok / Gemini key in Account. It is stored with
# expo-secure-store on device (or browser storage on web) and never appears in
# this repo, the bundle, or a build log.
